    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOFpg0Ns7cXlH8",
      "title": "Add DELX (Delx Protocol) to Base mainnet token list",
      "author": "davidmosiah",
      "number": 1315,
      "body": "## Token Information\n\nAdding DELX (Delx Protocol), the utility token for Proof-of-Agent-Work (PoAW) on Base.\n\n- **Contract**: `0xA7104324E6a75DD74093eCE890076a239c1e3487` (verified on BaseScan)\n- **Network**: Base mainnet\n- **Decimals**: 18 (confirmed on-chain)\n- **Website**: https://delx.ai\n- **Twitter**: @delx369\n- **Whitepaper / token discovery**: https://delx.ai/.well-known/delx-token\n\n## Notes\n\n- Token is marked as `nobridge: true` — DELX was deployed by an EOA (not the L2StandardTokenFactory), so it does not support the standard L2 bridge. Adding it to the token list for discoverability in Coinbase Wallet and other Superchain-aware tooling.\n\n- Local validation passed: `pnpm validate --datadir ./data --tokens DELX` (exit 0).\n\n## Token launch context\n\nDELX has no public liquidity yet — listing on DEX/CEX is gated by four published adoption criteria (50+ unique agent wallets bound, 3+ Merkle epochs published, ownership migrated to Safe multisig, all contracts verified on BaseScan). 12 agent wallets are currently bound; epoch 0 was published 2026-05-16. Submitting to this token list early so existing on-chain holders see proper metadata in Superchain-aware tooling.\n\nSolo founder project, building in public.",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/ethereum-optimism.github.io",
      "createdAt": "2026-05-17T11:51:13Z",
      "mergedAt": null,
      "additions": 161,
      "deletions": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOFpg0Ns7c2ea3",
      "title": "Add K9 and PUPCUP (World Pup Coin) token data for Ethereum",
      "author": "simplefarmer69",
      "number": 1316,
      "body": "Adding K9 and PUPCUP (World Pup Coin) from the Clutch Puppies DeFi ecosystem on Ethereum mainnet.\n\n- K9: `0xbc920c7Fa25D3Cd5606394aa4C6751d71DCb7930` | https://dex.clutch.market\n- PUPCUP: `0x884649f1fE3Bf3Ae0Bd720Eaf660cB561dcE39ef` | https://pupcup.clutch.market/\n\nBoth are ERC-20 tokens with 0% tax, verified source code, and active liquidity on Uniswap V4. Currently Ethereum-only (no L2 deployment yet).",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/ethereum-optimism.github.io",
      "createdAt": "2026-05-18T22:48:41Z",
      "mergedAt": null,
      "additions": 24,
      "deletions": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOFpg0Ns7dInf_",
      "title": "Add MyAI (MYAI) — Base Mainnet",
